# Image Upload Service configuration.
#
# Copy this file to .env and replace the example key:
#     PowerShell:  Copy-Item .env.example .env
#     bash:        cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored. Never commit it, and never paste a real key into this file.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API_KEYS (required)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every request except GET /health, /docs and /openapi.json must send one of
# these keys in the X-API-Key header. If API_KEYS is missing or empty, both the
# API and the Celery worker refuse to start.
#
# How to generate a key
#   1. From the project root, run:
#          uv run python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
#      This prints 43 random URL-safe characters (32 bytes of entropy), e.g.
#          Xq3v9L0b...   (yours will differ)
#      Alternative if OpenSSL is installed:
#          openssl rand -base64 32
#   2. Paste the output after "API_KEYS=" in .env. No quotes, no spaces.
#   3. Restart the API and the worker. Keys are read only at startup.
#
# Rules for keys
#   - Generate keys with the command above. Do not invent them by hand.
#   - Use one key per client (for example, one for you, one for the reviewer),
#     so that you can revoke one client without affecting the others.
#   - Do not use a comma inside a key. The comma separates keys.
#   - Keys are never logged. Do not put them in commits, tickets or chat.
#
# Several keys: separate them with commas.
#     API_KEYS=first-key,second-key
#
# Rotate a key without downtime for clients:
#   1. Generate a new key and append it:   API_KEYS=old-key,new-key
#   2. Restart the API, then move every client to the new key.
#   3. Remove the old key:                 API_KEYS=new-key
#   4. Restart the API again.
#
# Use the key
#   - curl:    curl -X POST -H "X-API-Key: <your-key>" http://127.0.0.1:8000/uploads
#   - Swagger: open http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs, click "Authorize", paste the key.

API_KEYS=dev-key-ganti-saya
